{"id":"vod_md_5326","vodId":"5326","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"浪客剑心 明治剑客浪漫谭","name_cn":"浪客剑心 明治剑客浪漫谭","date":"2023-01-01","year":"2023","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"24集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230921-1/8974a50d48e10f5c09b66577c0719b13.jpg"},"summary":"浪客剑心 -明治剑客浪漫谭-》于1994年在《周刊少年JUMP》上开始连载，迄今已被动画化了5次。本作是从原作第一章开始重新构筑的新作电视动画。在幕末的动乱时期，曾有一个被人畏惧地称之为“刽子手拔刀斋”的维新志士。而那个男人在新时代到来之际消失在众人面前，只留下了最强剑客的传说。时光流逝——时值明治11年，地点在东京下町。腰上佩着逆刃刀，发誓不杀的流浪剑客绯村剑心，与神谷活心流代理师父神谷薰相遇了。剑心帮助解决了冒充活心流当街杀人的“刽子手拔刀斋”一案后，以此为契机暂住在薰的家中。他遇到了东京府士族出身的明神弥彦，自称打架专家的相乐左之助，与他们成为了伙伴，还因为过去的恩怨，与自己的宿敌们对战。努力活在新时代的人交织而成的明治剑...","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-12-16 08:51:46","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230919/Dun9hgcN/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230919/AbljtXPB/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230919/fHmSKDOM/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230919/xyqyuaWt/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230919/J38GRZgM/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230919/k5bhc7nA/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230919/2wisg4za/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230925/1r4uVvJv/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230928/AnXWG81P/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231006/zAKe3vIz/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231015/bT1aTSdY/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231020/AU3yaGGe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231103/zKY3e8uK/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231105/8ZExCzSU/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/202311